Hyprland compositor config -- was the daily-driver rice. Includes
scripts/quickshell/Shell.qml (the real, live quickshell shell -- see
scripts/quickshell/), the wallpaper picker, calendar (with the excluded
OpenWeather key, see .env.example), and matugen-generated colors.conf. Was
the biggest and most load-bearing folder in this whole backup.

NO LONGER ACTIVELY USED as of the MangoWC migration (2026-08-05) -- the
compositor is mango now, not Hyprland. Kept here as-is, not being re-synced
from a live source anymore. See ../mangoconfigs/ for the current setup.
Possible this gets removed from the local working tree down the line if
nothing ends up depending on it -- that only affects future checkouts, not
git history; already-pushed commits stay on GitHub permanently either way.
